---
import PolicyPage from '../components/PolicyPage.astro';
---

<PolicyPage title="Privacy Policy" description="What Melt & Box Co. collects when you order, why, and how to ask us to delete it." updated="13 October 2026">
  <p>Your privacy matters to us. This page explains what we collect and why.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name and email address from Google when you sign in to place an order.</li>
    <li>The WhatsApp number, delivery address and any customisation notes you enter at checkout.</li>
    <li>Your order details (items, prices, status).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't use analytics, advertising trackers or cookies to follow you. Your browser stores your cart and sign-in on your own device so they survive a page reload.</p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To confirm your order on WhatsApp, collect payment and ship it to you.</li>
    <li>To email you order confirmations and status updates.</li>
    <li>To save your details so checkout is quicker next time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Where it's kept</h2>
  <p>Orders and saved checkout details are stored in Google Firebase, protected so that only you and the shop owner can read them. Order emails are sent from our Gmail account.</p>

  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>We never take payment on the website and never see or store card details. You pay us directly (for example by UPI) after we confirm your order.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share your name, phone number and address only with the courier delivering your order. We never sell your data.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete your details at any time by messaging us on WhatsApp.</p>
</PolicyPage>
